      "side": 1,
      "message": "You want less DEBUG log but more VERBOSE log ?\n\nIn my mind if you enable a log in verbose, you are enabling it in all layer that are above it like debug / info / warn / error.\nI am not sure of the exact order but verbose is the lowest one.\n\n\nDo you mean you want some TAG to output the verbose without the debug ?\nDoing this would be weird in my opinion..",
