      "writtenOn": "2023-03-22T02:54:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The intent was to use the new verbose flag (defaulted to True) to allow Android to continue to have the same behavior (enabling debug also enables verbose) but give the option of allowing debug logs without verbose.\n\ni.e. enable debug logs via tags but disable verbose logs entirely.\n\nMaybe I should rename this to `INIT_verbose_logs_disabled`?",
      "parentUuid": "fc189ae1_dc961cb3",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 9,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 12,
        "endChar": 0
      },
